🏨 2. 京都府のお盆直前おすすめ宿一覧</h2>\n<p>楽天トラベルの京都府エリア掲載宿から、高評価な施設を厳選掲載しています。</p>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/10 via-orange-500/10 to-yellow-500/10 border border-amber-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-amber-900 bg-amber-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase\">✨ おすすめ 第1位</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-amber-900 bg-white border border-gray-300/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\">京都府</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-amber-800\">⭐ 4.2 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/32464/32464.jpg\" alt=\"貸切風呂旅館　こぶし（ＡＳＯＢＩＹＵＫＵ　京都るり渓温泉）\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-amber-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    \n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center border-t border-amber-200/60 mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3\">\n    <a href=\"/prefectures/kyoto/\" class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-900 underline\">\n      🎌 京都府の厳選特集一覧を見る →\n    </a>\n  </div>\n\n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-amber-50/50 border border-amber-200 shadow-sm space-y-6\">\n  <div class=\"border-b border-amber-200 pb-3 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-2\">\n    <div>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n        🏨 貸切風呂旅館　こぶし（ＡＳＯＢＩＹＵＫＵ　京都るり渓温泉） 宿泊前に知っておきたい詳細スペック＆設備\n      </h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-600 mt-1\">【2026お盆直前】京都の直前予約おすすめホテル・町家旅館特集｜五山送り火・お盆限定プランのお風呂・お食事・館内設備・アクセス情報の詳細ガイド</p>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full border border-amber-300\">総合評価 ⭐ 4.2 (356件)<